                      <story-point captured-sheet='Weekly Engagement Heatmap' id='6' />
                      <story-point captured-sheet='Weekday Analysis' id='8' />
                      <story-point captured-sheet='Hashtag Analysis' id='7' />
                      <story-point captured-sheet='Emotion vs Engagement' id='9' />
                      <story-point captured-sheet='Engagement Rate by Reach' id='10' />
                    </story-points>
                  </flipboard>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='54466' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='47191' x='52895' y='47461'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>This chart reflects a business model where </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>volume and engagement balance drive growth</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>. Posting consistently built visibility, but the turning point came when engagement rates surpassed “Strong” and “Excellent” benchmarks. That shift shows the model isn’t about flooding content—it’s about </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>quality interactions that convert reach into loyalty</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>. The dual lines highlight the trade‑off: more posts raise exposure, but only impactful content sustains audience trust. For the business, this means focusing resources on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>fewer, high‑value campaigns</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> that maximize ROI, reduce wasted effort, and transform activity into measurable revenue gains.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='68651' hidden='true' id='11' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='30078' x='69317' y='11208'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>This chart  Sugar Cosmetics’ Instagram story: no matter the format—Image, Reel, Story, or Video—audiences show almost equal love, with engagement hovering around </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>12K+ interactions each</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>. That balance says people aren’t chasing one type of content; they’re connecting with the brand itself. It’s proof that consistency and authenticity matter more than format. The takeaway for the business is powerful: every post is a chance to spark conversation, whether it’s a quick Story or a polished Reel. By staying true to its voice across formats, Sugar Cosmetics builds trust and keeps its community engaged day after day.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='72504' hidden='true' id='12' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='56353' x='41832' y='24518'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This chart tells a compelling business model story: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>every campaign type—Festive, Giveaway, Influencer, Product, Tutorial—delivers nearly identical engagement (~32.7–33%)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. That consistency signals a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>robust, diversified strategy</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> where no single campaign dominates, but each contributes steady value. The insight is clear: the business doesn’t rely on one “hero” campaign; instead, it thrives on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>balanced execution across formats</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. This model reduces risk, ensures predictable engagement, and highlights that success comes from </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>sustained variety and audience touchpoints</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. In practice, it means the company can confidently invest across campaigns, knowing each reliably fuels growth.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='61646' hidden='true' id='13' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='60501' x='37684' y='35377'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This chart highlights a business model built on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>balanced source efficiency</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. Collab, Influencer, Organic, and Paid channels all deliver nearly equal impact (~242–250), showing that the brand isn’t dependent on one pipeline. Instead, it thrives on a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>multi‑channel ecosystem</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> where each source contributes steady value. The insight is powerful: Organic reach edges slightly ahead, proving authentic audience connection is the most efficient driver, while Paid ensures scale. Together, the model reduces risk, maximizes stability, and empowers the business to </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>allocate resources flexibly across sources</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> without losing momentum—turning diversification into a competitive advantage.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='91419' hidden='true' id='14' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='39153' x='59032' y='5604'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This heatmap tells a very human story: people engage differently depending on how they feel and what’s happening around them. When audiences are </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>curious</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, influencer collaborations and tutorials spark the most attention mid‑week, showing that learning and discovery drive connection. When they’re </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>excited or inspired</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, product launches and festive offers light up Fridays and Saturdays, tapping into anticipation and celebration. The rhythm reflects real life—weekdays bring curiosity and focus, weekends bring energy and joy. For the business, it’s about meeting emotions where they naturally rise, turning campaigns into conversations that feel personal, timely, and meaningful.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='26620' hidden='true' id='15' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='96802' x='1383' y='70403'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>This hashtag chart tells a very human story: people respond most when the content feels authentic and aligned with their values. Combinations like </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>#BoldLooks, #VeganBeauty, #CrueltyFree, #MakeupGoals</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> spark the highest engagement because they connect beauty with ethics and aspiration. It shows that audiences aren’t just scrolling—they’re choosing to engage with messages that reflect their lifestyle and beliefs. The takeaway is simple: hashtags aren’t just labels, they’re signals of identity. By weaving them thoughtfully, the brand speaks the language of its community, turning everyday posts into conversations that matter.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='61646' id='16' story-point-id='8' type-v2='text' w='60501' x='37684' y='35377'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Here’s a more humanized version of the weekday analysis story:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The chart shows how people connect most during the week. Engagement climbs on Tuesday and Friday, when audiences are active and ready to interact, while weekends slow down a little as people step away. It’s a reminder that timing matters—sharing your most important campaigns mid‑week can spark stronger conversations, while weekends are perfect for lighter, casual posts. The rhythm feels natural: weekdays bring focus and energy, weekends bring pause. By aligning content with this flow, the business can meet people where they are, turning everyday patterns into lasting impact.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='39755' hidden='true' id='17' story-point-id='9' type-v2='text' w='92826' x='5186' y='50613'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This chart engagement beautifully: it shows that people connect most when they feel </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>inspired (37.36M)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> or </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>excited (37.06M)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, but confidence and happiness aren’t far behind. What it really says is that emotions drive interaction—audiences don’t just react to content, they respond when it resonates with how they feel in the moment. For the business, this means campaigns should be crafted to </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>spark feelings, not just clicks</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. When posts inspire or excite, they create energy; when they build confidence or happiness, they nurture trust. It’s a reminder that behind every number is a human story.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='85464' hidden='true' id='18' story-point-id='10' type-v2='text' w='49352' x='48833' y='11559'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This scatter plot tells a very human story: reach alone doesn’t guarantee impact. The average engagement rate sits at </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>32.89%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, but the spread of points shows that some posts resonate deeply while others barely spark. It’s a reminder that behind every dot is a real audience moment—sometimes inspired, sometimes indifferent. The business takeaway is simple: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>quality beats quantity</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. When content connects emotionally, engagement rises above the average line, proving that people respond to meaning, not just exposure. In practice, it’s about crafting posts that feel personal and relevant, turning numbers into genuine conversations.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{9091F294-2EF2-4C0B-BE86-0C6F3F912ACD}' />
    </dashboard>
